o Quality\nSeamless loop Video\n\nGoals for next update:\nIncrease Video Quality (5.6k)\n\nEmail suggestions: VRBackgroundsemail@gmail.com", "short_description": "Escape. Relax. Immerse.\n\nExperience the tranquility of a snowy Yosemite Mountain and the calm of a distant waterfall. Whether you're working, meditating, or unwinding, this background offers the perfect escape. Enjoy a movie, surf the web, or simply unwind. Transport yourself to a place of relaxation\u2014even if you can't be there in person.\n\nSpecifications:\n4k Video Quality\nSeamless loop Video\n\nGoals for next update:\nIncrease Video Quality (5.6k)\n\nEmail suggestions: VRBackgroundsemail@gmail.com"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://vr.gixcore.com/SnowyMountain-Privacy-Policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Robert A Bishop", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "Http://vr.gixcore.com/SnowyWinterMountains.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["af", "ak", "sq", "arq", "am", "ar", "hy", "frp", "rup", "as", "cy", "wa", "vi", "uz", "ur", "uk", "ug", "tuk", "tr", "tir", "bo", "te", "th", "tt", "ta_LK", "ta", "tzm", "tg", "tl", "gsw", "sv", "su", "sw", "es_VE", "es", "es_PE", "es_PR", "es_MX", "es_CO", "es_AR", "es_CL", "azb", "so", "sl", "si", "sk", "sd", "sr", "szl", "gd", "sa_IN", "srd", "rue", "sah", "ru", "ru_UA", "roh", "pa", "rhg", "ro", "pt", "pt_BR", "pl", "fa_AF", "az", "az_TR", "bcc", "ba", "eu", "bel", "bn", "bs", "br", "ca", "b